hat integrated minigames with viewers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invite other streamers to collaborate with you in VR!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash chaos with a wide collection of items and weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Load custom environments from the workshop that are built by viewers!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279000/extras/a4b5ca72e7491718d3a15e812f09ee48.avif?t=1771770144\" width=1000 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a viewer, you won't have to pay at all to join your favourite streamer live on stream as a little Byte! You'll be able to interact, message and even voice chat with the streamer and other community members!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279000/extras/7151a0937fbfcbb87a601820968702c6.avif?t=1771770144\" width=1000 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To really show off your creative fashion sense, there are a wide range of cosmetics that can be worn by your Byte, ranging from funky hats to funky glasses and everything in-between! All you need to do is open your free daily crate and see what you get, or if you just can't wait, you can also purchase them from the shop!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279000/extras/14931963004d84d00f42fbf0c4b85465.avif?t=1771770144\" width=1000 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No stream is complete without an amazing background environment, so feel free to check out the built-in level editor! You can design amazing worlds for your streamer to check out, and upload it directly to the Steam Workshop for anyone to download. The possibilities are endless!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NOTE:\u00a0</strong>Only works with Twitch and TikTok at the moment, but more platforms may be added in the future!</p>","developers":["Finndustries"],"dlc":[3889660],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279000/60e5780b4f7c3a9a0e4da5222ac10d94a2b6e8f3/header.jpg?t=1771770144","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3279000/1442629054/e6fd0aa28b12640391ea32b425c8d312b8950288/1768103670/dash_av1.mpd?t=1768105526","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3279000/1442629054/e6fd0aa28b12640391ea32b425c8d312b8950288/1768103670/dash_h264.mpd?t=1768105526","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3279000/1442629054/e6fd0aa28b12640391ea32b425c8d312b8950288/1768103670/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1768105526","id":257184554,"name":"BYTEWORLD Teaser","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257184554/cf2753f85442cb533859bb096b812461fadb0568/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1768105526"}],"name":"BYTEWORLD","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4590 / AMD FX 8350<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 970 / AMD Radeon R9 290<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> OpenXR</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"p